Subject: [PATCH 117/158] soc/amd: Generate AMD PSP FW SBOM if requested
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Michał Żygowski <michal.zygowski@3mdeb.com>
(cherry picked from commit de54d62762abc7eed0241b52f66bfb3afcc8cf88)
---
 src/sbom/Kconfig                  | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/soc/amd/cezanne/Makefile.mk   |  3 ++-
 src/soc/amd/common/Makefile.mk    |  4 ++++
 src/soc/amd/genoa_poc/Makefile.mk |  3 ++-
 src/soc/amd/glinda/Makefile.mk    |  3 ++-
 src/soc/amd/mendocino/Makefile.mk |  3 ++-
 src/soc/amd/phoenix/Makefile.mk   |  3 ++-
